    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<strong>The rest of the universe is very dangerous. Use that to your advantage.</strong><br><br>I Made Myself a Ship is a game about systems and components, using them to add and upgrade the capabilities of your ship to destroy more enemies in your quest to decimate everything and collect it for yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/a913c810886ed0862338ef97d5bce769.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/a913c810886ed0862338ef97d5bce769.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/a913c810886ed0862338ef97d5bce769.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Destroy enemy ships to collect systems and components, then place systems on your ship to add effects. Add homing to your shots to make sure they hit, fire volleys of shots to take down larger opponents, add explosions to wipe out multiple ships at once, reinforce your hull to fly straight through enemies, shield yourself to survive, and so much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/ba0def33cb4d59f13a09edf66f85728a.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/ba0def33cb4d59f13a09edf66f85728a.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/ba0def33cb4d59f13a09edf66f85728a.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Attach components to your systems to increase their effects. Scaling up systems makes them stronger, as long as you can make room for them. Every system can be scaled up, leaving you with a hard choice: to use a large variety of systems, or just a few very powerful ones. Or something in between?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/58ac58346901161b492bd5f074645e10.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/58ac58346901161b492bd5f074645e10.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/58ac58346901161b492bd5f074645e10.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Not everything is about weapons, however. Want to be tanky? Use barriers to maintain shields to survive longer. Want to go fast? Or faster? Or faster still? Add components to your engines system until you're satisfied. One of the main design goals of the game is to let you build the ship you want to build, as long as you can cover the energy costs of whatever you want to do. It's your ship, make it yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/de8f8acf4c29975e5a26c5c9fda8785f.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/de8f8acf4c29975e5a26c5c9fda8785f.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/de8f8acf4c29975e5a26c5c9fda8785f.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your ship can be very agile, letting you dodge and weave around enemies. Maneuver around enemies and asteroids to survive, and use various weapons to destroy everything that comes close.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/93adca3282b309df074c9984847088cc.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/93adca3282b309df074c9984847088cc.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/93adca3282b309df074c9984847088cc.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>I Made Myself a Ship is a very fast paced game, where both you and the enemies fly and die at high speeds. Overwhelm everything you face as you take down larger and larger opponents, collect their resources, and build yourself larger and larger to become unbeatable.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>The rest of the universe is very dangerous. Use that to your advantage.</strong><br><br>I Made Myself a Ship is a game about systems and components, using them to add and upgrade the capabilities of your ship to destroy more enemies in your quest to decimate everything and collect it for yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/a913c810886ed0862338ef97d5bce769.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/a913c810886ed0862338ef97d5bce769.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/a913c810886ed0862338ef97d5bce769.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Destroy enemy ships to collect systems and components, then place systems on your ship to add effects. Add homing to your shots to make sure they hit, fire volleys of shots to take down larger opponents, add explosions to wipe out multiple ships at once, reinforce your hull to fly straight through enemies, shield yourself to survive, and so much more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/ba0def33cb4d59f13a09edf66f85728a.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/ba0def33cb4d59f13a09edf66f85728a.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/ba0def33cb4d59f13a09edf66f85728a.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Attach components to your systems to increase their effects. Scaling up systems makes them stronger, as long as you can make room for them. Every system can be scaled up, leaving you with a hard choice: to use a large variety of systems, or just a few very powerful ones. Or something in between?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/58ac58346901161b492bd5f074645e10.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/58ac58346901161b492bd5f074645e10.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/58ac58346901161b492bd5f074645e10.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Not everything is about weapons, however. Want to be tanky? Use barriers to maintain shields to survive longer. Want to go fast? Or faster? Or faster still? Add components to your engines system until you're satisfied. One of the main design goals of the game is to let you build the ship you want to build, as long as you can cover the energy costs of whatever you want to do. It's your ship, make it yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/de8f8acf4c29975e5a26c5c9fda8785f.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/de8f8acf4c29975e5a26c5c9fda8785f.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/de8f8acf4c29975e5a26c5c9fda8785f.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your ship can be very agile, letting you dodge and weave around enemies. Maneuver around enemies and asteroids to survive, and use various weapons to destroy everything that comes close.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/93adca3282b309df074c9984847088cc.poster.avif?t=1737434436\" width=616 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/93adca3282b309df074c9984847088cc.webm?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2577160/extras/93adca3282b309df074c9984847088cc.mp4?t=1737434436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>I Made Myself a Ship is a very fast paced game, where both you and the enemies fly and die at high speeds. Overwhelm everything you face as you take down larger and larger opponents, collect their resources, and build yourself larger and larger to become unbeatable.",
